  "body": "Seize a rare and highly lucrative opportunity in the heart of the highly sought-after coastal town. This flat, centrally located 1,156m2 parcel of freehold land comes with an approved Resource Consent to build seven premium, two-level townhouses. With the heavy lifting of the planning phase already completed, this property is primed for developers and investors looking to capitalize on Orewa's coastal property market or simply enjoy the coastal lifestyle immediately. Live in the current home while you map out the property's potential, with massive space for all your recreational gear.\r\n\r\nThe true value of this site lies in its unbeatable location:\r\n* Unrivaled Convenience:  Situated just a stone's throw from the Orewa town centre, residents will be steps away from major supermarkets, medical centres, and everyday amenities.   \r\n* Beach Proximity: A short, flat stroll takes you directly to the golden sands and rolling surf of Orewa Beach.   \r\n* Vibrant Community: Future residents can immerse themselves in the local lifestyle, whether it's walking the dog on the beach, participating in surf life-saving activities, or enjoying the bustling local promenade filled with cafes, eateries, and boutique shops.   \r\n\r\nWith the demand for low-maintenance, high-quality living in central Orewa, these consented townhouses represent an outstanding project.\r\n\r\nContact us today to request the approved Resource Consent and site plans or to view the property.  Register your interest with the agents today!\r\n\r\nAuction 10th December 2026 on site 4:00pm",
